# Active Directory Home Lab

## Overview ##

This project demonstrates how I built an Active Directory lab using Windows Server 2025 and VMware Workstation Pro.

## Objectives ##

- Install Windows Server
- Configure Active Directory
- Create users
- Create Organizational Units
- Configure Group Policy
- Investigate Event Logs
- Join a Windows client to the domain

## Environment ##

- VMware Workstation Pro
- Windows Server 2025
- Windows 11
- 8 GB RAM
- 2 CPUs

## Skills Learned ##

- Active Directory
- DNS
- User Management
- Group Policy
- Event Viewer
- Windows Administration
